msgid "Your credit score, made fair."
msgstr "तुमचो क्रेडीट स्कोअर, फेयर केलो."

msgid ""
"FairCreditScore is an alternative credit scoring platform for the 400+ "
"million Indians who transact every day on UPI but stay invisible to "
"traditional bureaus. Powered by FairCreditAI and the RBI Account Aggregator "
"framework."
msgstr ""
"FairCreditScore हें 400+ दशलक्ष भारतीयां खातीर एक पर्यायी क्रेडीट स्कोअरिंग "
"प्लॅटफॉर्म आसा जे दर दिसा यूपीआयचेर वेव्हार करतात पूण पारंपारीक ब्युरोंक "
"अदृश्य रावतात. FairCreditAI आनी आरबीआय खातें एकठांय करपी चौकटी वरवीं "
"संचालित."

msgid "Individual Customer"
msgstr "वैयक्तीक गिरायक"

msgid ""
"Generate your FairCreditScore in seconds. Upload a bank statement and see "
"what helped or hurt your score."
msgstr ""
"सेकंदां भितर तुमचो FairCreditScore तयार करचो. बँक स्टेटमेंट अपलोड करात आनी "
"तुमच्या गूणांक कितें मजत जाली वा कितें दुखयलें तें पळयात."

msgid "Get my score"
msgstr "म्हजो गूण मेळोवचो"

msgid "Financial Institutions"
msgstr "वित्तीय संस्थांनी"

msgid ""
"Operations console for partner banks and NBFCs &mdash; onboard customers, "
"generate scores on their behalf."
msgstr ""
"भागीदार बँको आनी एनबीएफसी खातीर ऑपरेशन्स कंसोल &mdash; ऑनबोर्ड गिरायकांक, "
"तांचे वतीन गूण तयार करतात."

msgid "Request access"
msgstr "प्रवेशाची विनंती करची"

msgid "Consent-based"
msgstr "संमती आदारीत"

msgid ""
"Share data once via the RBI-licensed Account Aggregator framework. No screen"
" scraping, no document hassle."
msgstr ""
"आरबीआय परवानो आशिल्ल्या खातें एकठांय करपी चौकटी वरवीं एकदां डेटा वांटप. "
"स्क्रीन स्क्रेपिंग ना, दस्तावेजाचो त्रास ना."

msgid "Explainable"
msgstr "स्पश्ट करपाक मेळटा"

msgid ""
"Every score comes with a SHAP-style breakdown of what helped or hurt &mdash;"
" no black box."
msgstr ""
"Every score comes with a SHAP-style breakdown of what helped or hurt &mdash;"
" no black box."

msgid "Inclusive"
